  "createdAt": "2026-10-27T21:56:08Z",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3; font-family: Rubik, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">The PetPocket foldable kennel is a comfortable bed and a cozy shelter for a cat or dog. Made of durable, ecological, soft fabrics and materials. It is characterized by an interesting, modern design in a scandinavian style. The pet home is made of recycled materials and is certified in terms of safety for the health of Your pet. \u00a0<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">PRODUCT FEATURES:</strong></p><ul style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(33, 37, 41); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Rubik, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Product<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">2-in-1</strong>: bed and home</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">A comfortable and cozy shelter for your pet</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Provides calm and exceptional comfort</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">The kennel has<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">soundproofing properties</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span>thanks to the fabric used, which isolates the animal acoustically and protects the animal from the noise</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">The kennel is<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">bite, tear and scratch resistant</strong>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Easy assembly and transport</strong></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Universal colors and simple design, matching any interior</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Made of durable, ecological materials</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Easy removal of hair and dirt</strong></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Easily to clean,<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">standard washing</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span>of the cover in 30\u00b0C</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Anti-allergic</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span>SoftFoam insert<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">does not contain heavy metals, does not sensitize</strong>, does not mold, is<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">resistant to deformation</strong>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Various color variants</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Certified with Oeko-Tex 100</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span>and<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Global Recycle Standard</strong>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Made and sewn in Poland</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p></p><p style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 21px; caret-color: rgb(33, 37, 41); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Rubik, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">The mattress cover is there\u00a0completely<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">removable</strong>.</p><p style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 21px; caret-color: rgb(33, 37, 41); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Rubik, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">It can be<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">easily washed</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span>in a standard 30 \u00b0 C wash,\u00a0and the inside of the mattress\u00a0under running water.\u00a0The underside is<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">non-slip</strong>.</p>",
