 {
  "id": "gid://shopify/Product/16144150036810",
  "title": "DOEL 2026 Upgrade Automatic Smart Litter Box, Self-Cleaning Cat Litter",
  "handle": "doel-2026-upgrade-automatic-smart-litter-box-self-cleaning-cat-litter",
  "vendor": "AliExpress",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "productType": "Other",
  "tags": [],
  "createdAt": "2026-10-27T22:08:01Z",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(226, 115, 0);font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Kindly Notice: </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">The infrared sensor has been removed to avoid false triggers and malfunctions. The litter box remains safe and reliable with enhanced precision gravity sensors, suitable for your cat.<br>Please be careful if you mind, thanks! \u00a0Some images and product reviews still mention the infrared feature, but it is no longer available. We are still in the process of updating this information. I apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused you. \u00a0</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Should you encounter any issues with the product, please contact us first. We can assist you in filing an after-sales service request, which saves time and avoids unnecessary costs. There\u2019s no need to rush into returns or disputes\u2014most problems can be resolved through effective communication. Thank you for your cooperation.</span></p><p><br><br></p><div>\n<p style=\"line-height:2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u26d4 Do not place the device on carpets or mats as this may interfere with the sensors of the device and cause malfunctions. Please place the device </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>on aflat floor </strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">and do not block the entrance to the cat litter box.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\ud83d\udc40 Compatible with cat litter: This product is </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>suitable forsmall diameter</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> tofu cat litter that can be clumped, mixed cat litter, bentonite cat litter, and mineral cat litter. </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Not suitable</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> for tofu and mixed cat litter with a </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>diameter </strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">greater </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>than 3mm</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> and a </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>length </strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">greater </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>than 15mm</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">, as it can cause significant waste of cat litter. Do not use </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>non clumping</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> cat litter.</span></p>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Features:</strong></span></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\ud83d\ude3b [Upgraded Design] The seamless main bucket effectively reduces litter leakage. The modern, stylish appearance matches any home decor.. Wider, deeper, and rounded anti-leak edges combined with the upgraded litter pad prevent litter buildup and urine leakage, even when cats urinate near the rim.</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> (</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">only supports 2.4GHz WiFi.)</span></strong></p>\n<div><br></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\ud83d\ude3b [Large Space] Totally 65L of toilet space and fecal collection space, yet only 4.6 ft\u00b3/0.13m\u00b3 in size, this automatic litter box offers a spacious interior for cats weighing between 3.3lbs/1.5kg and 15lbs/7kg. The generous waste collection compartment can support a 12lbs cat for up to two weeks, so you can travel without worry.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\ud83d\ude3b[Precise Weight Sensing ] Enhanced power keeps the litter surface flat. Replaces error-prone infrared sensors with 2nd-generation weight sensors, delivering high accuracy with weighing error &lt; 4% (lab-tested). More stable recognition, fewer false triggers, safer and more reliable performance.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\ud83d\ude3b[Upgraded Filter &amp; Durable Base Tray] New filter material offers better anti-deformation and a refined look. The optimized litter pad frame fits tightly with double anti-leak edges for better elasticity and durability. The large-capacity litter pad features superior anti-adhesion and tear resistance.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\ud83d\ude3b[Sturdy Cat Door &amp; Effective Odor Control] Infinite-rotation hinge prevents damage from over-rotation. The lightweight, flat door ensures smooth opening and closing, forms a tight seal, and effectively locks in odors.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\ud83d\ude3b [Easy Magnetic Garbage Bag Installation] Magnetic pressure ring design allows simple and secure garbage bag installation. Prevents falling or misalignment, improves airtightness, and stops odors from escaping. \u00a0</span></p>\n<div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">**Others:**</span></strong></p>\n<div><div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- The product dimensions have been optimized to save more space. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- Net Weight: 7.9kg/17.5lb</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- Gross Weight: 10kg/22.1b</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- Product Size: 485(Wx530(D)x505(H)mm / 19.1(Wx20.9(D)x19.9(H)inch</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- Packaging Size: 507(Wx555(D)x530(H)mm / 20(W)x21.9(D)x20.9(H)inch</span></p>\n<div><br></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 102, 0);color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">The manual states that filter A or B is included, but currently, the package only contains filter A. The filter B is optional. Please take note of this. Thank you.</span></strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p><br></p>\n</div><p><br></p>",
